#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:27
msgid "Default Virtual Switch Behavior (vs0 — General)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:29
msgid ""
"When a cluster is provisioned, a default Virtual Switch called ``vs0`` "
"(type: **General**) is created on the management interface. Understanding"
" its default behavior is critical before adding additional segments:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:31
msgid "**Default traffic on the management interface:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Live Migration** traffic flows over the management interface by "
"default, even if no explicit Live Migration segment has been created. A "
"dedicated Live Migration segment is only required when you want to "
"isolate migration traffic onto a separate VLAN or subnet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Data storage traffic** (NFS and iSCSI) can also flow over the "
"management interface through ``vs0`` by default. Creating dedicated Data "
"segments is recommended for performance and isolation in production "
"environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:36
msgid "**Adding segments to vs0:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:38
msgid ""
"When you edit ``vs0`` to add **Data (General)** and/or **Live Migration**"
" segments on the same Virtual Switch as the management interface, VLAN "
"tagging is required:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:40
msgid ""
"Adding **Data (General)** requires a VLAN tag and a dedicated IP subnet "
"for storage traffic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:41
msgid ""
"Adding **Live Migration** requires a VLAN tag and a dedicated IP subnet "
"for migration traffic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:42
msgid ""
"If both are added to the same Virtual Switch, each must have its **own "
"VLAN and subnet**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:44
msgid "**Splitting Data and Live Migration onto different networks:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:46
msgid ""
"When both **Data (General)** and **Live Migration** are selected on the "
"same Virtual Switch, a checkbox appears: *\"Data (General) and Live "
"Migration are on different networks\"*. When enabled:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:48
msgid "Two separate VLAN tags are required (one for Data, one for Live Migration)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:49
msgid "Two separate IP subnets must be configured"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/virtual_switches.rst:50
msgid ""
"This provides full isolation between storage and migration traffic while "
"sharing the same physical uplinks"
msgstr ""

